    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94934" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκῑρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hard</i>, of tempered iron, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				651
			</span></i>; <i>cancerous</i>, 
